&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 96.6px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;原則として&lt;br/&gt;３回/月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; width: 106px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -6px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;グループ全体並びに各執行部門の経営戦略及び経営課題の協議・検討&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 138.26666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
